 <td style="border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; height:6.95pt; vertical-align:middle; width:330px">
 <p style="text-align:center">180 ба түүнээс дээш</p>
 </td>
